                                                "sense_id": "72d8f49f-f123-3ba0-90d2-bbc0cb943bc2",
                                                "text": "he, I say, could passe into Affrike onely with two simple ships or small barkes, to commit himselfe in a strange and foe countrie, to engage his person, under the power of a barbarous King […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "foe",
